# Dusrel Mail VPS stack — example env file (v1 slice)
#
# Ise copy karke .env banao: cp .env.example .env
# .env KABHI Git me commit mat karo (gitignore me hai).
# Har value ke liye placeholder diya gaya hai — real value VPS par
# set karo. JWT secrets ke liye: openssl rand -hex 32
#
# Domain (final domain abhi lock nahi hua hai — docs me
# dusrel.com / mail.dusrel.com sirf example hain).
DOMAIN=dusrel.com
ACME_EMAIL=admin@example.com

# Hono APIs — dono services ko WAHI JWT secret chahiye, kyunki
# mail-api auth-api ke tokens ko signature se verify karta hai.
# Dono alag-alag secrets hue to mail-api har token reject karega.
# COMPOSE TRAP (docker-compose.yml se verified): mail-api
# container ko sirf MAIL_JWT_SECRET milta hai, AUTH_JWT_SECRET
# nahi milta — isliye is file me DONO vars set karna zaroori hai.
# Sirf AUTH_JWT_SECRET set karne se mail-api production me throw
# karegi (uske container me fallback var hai hi nahi).
AUTH_JWT_SECRET=change-me-64-hex-chars
MAIL_JWT_SECRET=change-me-64-hex-chars
# LOCKED (2026-10-31, user decision): AUTH_APP_URL se
# reset-password aur invite-accept ke LINKS bante hain
# (authService.ts me verified). Recovery pages account centre me
# hain, isliye value account.dusrel.com hai — mail app ka URL
# yahan rakhne se links tootenge (mail app me forgot/reset page
# hai hi nahi). auth.dusrel.com use NAHI karna hai.
AUTH_APP_URL=https://account.dusrel.com
# OPEN GAP (code change baaki hai): auth-api ka CORS code SINGLE
# origin leta hai (app.ts me verified), lekin auth-api ko mail app
# ke saath account centre bhi call karega. Neeche wali value se
# mail app to chal jayega, lekin account centre se auth calls
# CORS par fail hongi. Iske liye code me origin list support
# chahiye — tab tak yahan doosri value andaze se mat jodo.
AUTH_CORS_ORIGIN=https://mail.dusrel.com
# MAIL_CORS_ORIGIN me koi gap nahi hai: mail-api ko sirf mail app
# call karti hai, isliye mail app ka URL hi sahi hai.
MAIL_CORS_ORIGIN=https://mail.dusrel.com
# NODE_ENV: is file me set karne ki zaroorat nahi hai — compose
# API containers ke liye NODE_ENV=production khud set karta hai
# (docker-compose.yml me hardcoded, verified). Local/Render par
# alag se set karna hota hai (service .env.example dekho).

# Backup + monitoring (scripts/backup.sh + scripts/disk-alert.sh
# ke liye — ye values VPS host ke env/crontab me hongi, compose
# inhe pass nahi karta).
# BACKUP_DIR=/var/backups/dusrel-mail
# RETENTION_DAYS=7
# DISK_THRESHOLD=80
# DISK_MOUNT=/
# ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://ntfy.sh/dusrel-alerts-example
# (ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL optional hai — nahi set ho to alert sirf log
# me aayega, script fail nahi hoga.)
#
# BACKUP KE LIYE TEENO REQUIRED HAIN (backup.sh se verified —
# koi ek missing ho to script FAIL karta hai, isliye ye commented
# "reference" nahi, zaroori vars hain):
# R2_SOURCE_BUCKET=dusrel-mail-blobs
# R2_BACKUP_BUCKET=dusrel-mail-blobs-backup
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your-cloudflare-account-id
#
# BACKUP CREDENTIALS KA SAHI NAAM (pehle example me galat tha —
# cross-verification me pakda gaya): backup script ka `aws` CLI
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID / R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY NAHI padhta. Use ye
# chahiye (VPS host ke env me ya `aws configure` se):
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-access-key-id
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-secret-access-key
# Sirf R2_* naam set karne se backup ka R2 sync credentials error
# se fail hoga.

# Cloudflare R2 (Stalwart blob store, WebUI me set hoga — ye values
# yahan sirf reference ke liye hain, compose inhe Stalwart ko
# directly pass nahi karta; R2 credentials WebUI > Storage > Blob
# Store me dalne hain, env me kabhi commit nahi karne hain).
# Key kahan banegi: Cloudflare dashboard > R2 > API Tokens.
# Key ko DONO buckets (source + backup) par Object Read + Write
# permission chahiye, warna Stalwart blob write ya backup sync
# fail hoga.
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your-cloudflare-account-id
# R2_BUCKET=dusrel-mail-blobs
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-access-key-id
# R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-secret-access-key

# NON-ENV CREDENTIALS (ye .env me nahi dalte, phir bhi chahiye):
# - Stalwart admin password: first run par `docker logs
#   dusrel-stalwart` me milta hai, pehle login par TURANT badlo.
# - Uptime Kuma admin: first-run WebUI par banta hai (username +
#   password) — dashboard 127.0.0.1:3001 par hi khulta hai.
# - Deploy ke GitHub Secrets (.env me nahi, GitHub repo settings
#   me): RENDER_AUTH_DEPLOY_HOOK, RENDER_MAIL_DEPLOY_HOOK,
#   VPS_HOST, VPS_USER, VPS_SSH_KEY, VPS_COMPOSE_DIR — poori list
#   .github/workflows/README.md me hai.
